title: Plumb Bob
text: Drop the line down and it comes back up. Does it come back the same colour?
trick: a head-on reflector returns the beam through the doppler, which shifts it back; the splitter sends the echo out the other side
motif: plumb line with a bob
ink: 2.5
expect: reversals>=1, recolours>=1
